The 8x8 VGA font in font8x8.h is an IBM public-domain VGA bitmap font,
extracted from Debian console-setup-linux's Lat15-VGA8.psf.gz and reordered
to CP437. Debian's console-setup-linux copyright file states that the console
fonts are public domain. No console-setup program code is included.

https://sources.debian.org/src/console-setup/
https://github.com/dhepper/font8x8 (documents the public-domain IBM VGA fonts)
